; ==============================================================================
; reward_font_data.inc - 96 glyph 8x8 bytes inlined as DEFB statements
; ==============================================================================
; Bitmap data for the Reward 8x8 font from the ZX Origins collection by
; Damien Guard (https://damieng.com/zx-origins). The license expressly
; permits use "in your game" and lists DEFB-statement Z80 asm files as one
; of the source formats Damien himself distributes for the font. This file
; is the same 768 bytes that used to live in fonts/reward.ch8, transcribed
; into Z80 source so the font is not redistributed as a standalone font file.
;
; Layout: 96 consecutive chars (codepoint 0x20-0x7F), 8 B per char.
; Offset = (char - 0x20) * 8.
; ==============================================================================

